  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6e9cf928084b84439a97239fa36f412, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WandererNPC
  npcName: Wastelander
  examine: A scavenger in a gas mask, pack stuffed with other people's junk.
  lines:
  - Roxy's the one worth listening to. I just carry things and complain about it.
  - Water out past the creek is clean enough if you don't mind it looking back at
    you.
  - Heard something clicking out in the fields. Big. Glowing. I walked the other
    way.
  - You bank your stuff, right? Every crate in every town opens the same stash. Don't
    ask me how.
